caption: Eldritch Universal Traits
domain-rule: eldritch-universal-traits

A character with access to at least one Tier 2 Eldritch Gifts Tradition may purchase Mind Shield up to Will as an Eldritch Gifts trait. Mind Shield does not require a Gift Power Stunt or Tradition-specific discovery permission. Before any explicit Mastery conversion, it follows the Universal Origin Rule and therefore has both Psionic, -10%, and Super, -10%. It is fully point-paid and does not count as a Gift, Gift Trait, Root Trait, or other Tradition-specific retention source unless a Tradition explicitly says otherwise.
